    "detailed_description": "In <strong>Orrstead</strong>, you manage resources and peacefully grow a city, without punishing failure mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD A CITY</h2>Start by building houses, farms, and markets to keep your citizens fed and happy, allowing your city to grow.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/6c411fdffc0dca784444d651d84b57cd.poster.avif?t=1728269994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/6c411fdffc0dca784444d651d84b57cd.webm?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/6c411fdffc0dca784444d651d84b57cd.mp4?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLOCK TECHNOLOGY</h2>Orrstead borrows mechanics from incremental games like Cookie Clicker, with each building having exponentially increasing costs.<br><br>Overcome these costs by unlocking new technologies, which introduce new production chains, synergies, and mechanical depth.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/de9f744739d5da4443ad87439eec67e2.poster.avif?t=1728269994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/de9f744739d5da4443ad87439eec67e2.webm?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/de9f744739d5da4443ad87439eec67e2.mp4?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADAPT TO SEASONS</h2>Adapt to the changing seasons, with each season bringing new technologies, limitations, and strategies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/c5f5772fbc981cb8b27a3c5bbeb3f808.poster.avif?t=1728269994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/c5f5772fbc981cb8b27a3c5bbeb3f808.webm?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/c5f5772fbc981cb8b27a3c5bbeb3f808.mp4?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "In <strong>Orrstead</strong>, you manage resources and peacefully grow a city, without punishing failure mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD A CITY</h2>Start by building houses, farms, and markets to keep your citizens fed and happy, allowing your city to grow.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/6c411fdffc0dca784444d651d84b57cd.poster.avif?t=1728269994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/6c411fdffc0dca784444d651d84b57cd.webm?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/6c411fdffc0dca784444d651d84b57cd.mp4?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLOCK TECHNOLOGY</h2>Orrstead borrows mechanics from incremental games like Cookie Clicker, with each building having exponentially increasing costs.<br><br>Overcome these costs by unlocking new technologies, which introduce new production chains, synergies, and mechanical depth.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/de9f744739d5da4443ad87439eec67e2.poster.avif?t=1728269994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/de9f744739d5da4443ad87439eec67e2.webm?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/de9f744739d5da4443ad87439eec67e2.mp4?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADAPT TO SEASONS</h2>Adapt to the changing seasons, with each season bringing new technologies, limitations, and strategies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/c5f5772fbc981cb8b27a3c5bbeb3f808.poster.avif?t=1728269994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/c5f5772fbc981cb8b27a3c5bbeb3f808.webm?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/693940/extras/c5f5772fbc981cb8b27a3c5bbeb3f808.mp4?t=1728269994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
